# RetirementAfterEffective: SemQL validation on GovernanceRule of the GovernanceRules accelerator. The retirement date of a rule, when set, is after its effective date.
_package: GovernanceRules.entities.GovernanceRule.validations
_type: SemQLValidation
_name: RetirementAfterEffective
entity: GovernanceRules.entities.GovernanceRule.GovernanceRule
label: Retirement date after effective date
description: The retirement date of a rule, when set, is after its effective date.
validationScope: PRE_CONSO
validationLabel: The retirement date must be after the effective date.
condition: RetirementDate IS NULL OR EffectiveDate IS NULL OR RetirementDate > EffectiveDate
